msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /></head>"
"<body style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:helvetica\">\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><a name=\"topic\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:24pt;font-weight:600\">Topics</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#usage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Usage</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#connect\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Connect</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#disconnect\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Disconnect</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#external_help\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Getting external help</span>"
"</a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#homepage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Homepage</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#submitting_bugs\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Submitting bugs</span></a>"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#author\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Author</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"usage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Usage</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"connect\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Connect</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Start kvpnc and if vpnc-connect/vpnc-disconnect is not installed in "
"/usr/sbin change it in settings. Click on &quot;New profile...&quot; to add a "
"new profile. Enter the new Name in the upcoming dialog, fill in the empty "
"fields and save profile by clicking on &quot;Save profile...&quot;. After enter "
"your VPN data, click on &quot;connect&quot; to connect to your VPN server. By "
"default, kvpnc minimizes into kicker dock after sucessfull connect. <a "
"href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"disconnect\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Disconnect</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>To disconnect, click on kicker dock and kvpnc main window will be restored. "
"Then click on &quot;disconnect&quot;. You can also use toolbar icons or menu "
"entries in kicker dock context menu. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"external_help\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Getting external help</span>"
"</a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"homepage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Homepage</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Go to <a href=\"http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/\">http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/</a> "
"for new releases, contacts, etc. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"sumbitting_bugs\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Submitting bugs</span></a>"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Go to <a href=\"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc\">"
"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc</a> for submitting new bugs or look for open "
"bugs. <a href=\"#topic\">back to top</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"author\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Author</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Send a mail to Christoph Thielecke (<a href=\"u15119@hs-harz.de\">"
"u15119@hs-harz.de</a>) if you have questions, suggestions or wishes. <a "
"href=\"#topic\">back to top</a></p>\n"
"</body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /></head>"
"<body style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:helvetica\">\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><a name=\"topic\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:24pt;font-weight:600\">Temas</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#usage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Utilizazón</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#connect\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Conectar</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#disconnect\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Desconectar</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a href=\"#external_help\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Obtendo axuda externa</span>"
"</a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#homepage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Páxina web</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#submitting_bugs\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Envio de erros</span></a></p>"
"\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"#author\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Autor</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"usage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">1. Uso</span></a></p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"connect\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.1 Conectar</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Inície kvpnc e se vpnc-connect/vpnc-disconnect non está instalado en "
"/usr/sbin modifique a configurazón. Prema en &quot;Novo perfil...&quot; para "
"engadir un perfil novo. Introduza o novo Nome no diálogo que se mostra, "
"preencha os campos valeiro e guarde o perfil premendo en &quot;Guardar "
"perfil...&quot;. Após introducir os seus dados de VPN, prema en "
"&quot;conectar&quot; para conectar co seu revidor VPN. Por omisión, kvpnc "
"acopla-se na bandexa do sistema após estabelecer unha  conexón. <a "
"href=\"#topic\">acima</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"disconnect\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">1.2 Desconectar</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Para desconectar, prema no ícone da bandexa e restaurará a fiestra principal "
"de Kvpnc. Entón prema en &quot;desconectar&quot;.Tamén pode usar os ícones da "
"barra de ferramentas ou a entrada no menu emerxente da bandexa. <a "
"href=\"#topic\">acima</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:16px\"><a name=\"external_help\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:18pt;font-weight:600\">2. Obter axuda externa</span></a>"
"</p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"homepage\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.1 Páxina web</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Consulte <a "
"href=\"http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/\">http://home.gna.org/kvpnc/</a> "
"para novas versións, contactos, etc. <a href=\"#topic\">acima</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"sumbitting_bugs\">"
"<span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.2 Comunicando erros</span></a>"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Vaia a <a href=\"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc\">"
"https://gna.org/bugs/?group=kvpnc</a> para enviar novos erros ou procurar erros "
"abertos. <a href=\"#topic\">acima</a> </p>\n"
"<p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a name=\"author\"><span "
"style=\"font-size:14pt;font-weight:600\">2.3 Autor</span></a></p>\n"
"<p>Envie un correo a Christoph Thielecke (<a href=\"u15119@hs-harz.de\">"
"u15119@hs-harz.de</a>) se ten dúvidas, suxeréncias ou desexos. <a "
"href=\"#topic\">acima</a></p>\n"
"</body></html>"

